DOCUMENT();
loadMacros(
"PGstandard.pl",
"MathObjects.pl",
"PGML.pl"
);
Context("Interval");

$set_ans_6 = Compute("(-infinity, 13) U {0, 4, 5, 6, 17}");
$set_ans_7 = Compute("(-infinity, 13) U {0, 4, 5, 6, 17}");
$set_ans_3 = Compute("((-infinity, 18]) U (-infinity, 18] U (-infinity, 18]");
$set_ans_4 = Compute("{1, 10, 12, 19} U (-infinity, 18]");
$set_ans_5 = Compute("{1, 10, 12, 19} U {1, 10, 12, 19} U ({1, 10, 12, 19} U (-infinity, 18] U (((-infinity, 18] - ((-infinity, infinity) - (-infinity, 18])))) U (-infinity, 18]");
$set_ans_1 = Compute("(({7, 8, 15} U [4, 5])) - ((-infinity, infinity) - {8, 15, 16, 17}) - ((-infinity, infinity) - {7, 8, 15})");
$set_ans_2 = Compute("(({7, 8, 15})) U [4, 5] U {7, 8, 15}");
BEGIN_PGML
# Questions:

_For arithmetic problems, if the result is not an integer, then retain *three significant digits*._

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{8, 15, 16, 17\}`]
- [`B = \{7, 8, 15\}`]
- [`C = \{x | 4 \leq x \leq 5\}`]

Compute:
- [`((B \cup C)) \cap A \cap B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_1}
- [`((B)) \cup C \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_2}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x \leq 18\}`]
- [`B = \{1, 10, 12, 19\}`]

Compute:
- [`(A) \cup A \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_3}
- [`B \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_4}
- [`B \cup B \cup (B \cup A \cup ((A \cap A))) \cup A = `] [_____]{$set_ans_5}

---

Given the sets:
- [`A = \{x | x < 13\}`]
- [`B = \{0, 4, 5, 6, 17\}`]

Compute:
- [`A \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_6}
- [`A \cup B = `] [_____]{$set_ans_7}

---
END_PGML
ENDDOCUMENT();
